# Runtime data — **all of it**. Nothing under `data/` is ours: it is what one instance did,
# on one box. What a *fresh* install starts with lives in `seed/`, which is tracked, and the
# seeders copy it in on first boot without ever overwriting. Before 2026-08-28 the rubric and
# the knowledge base were committed here as well as shipped, which made the repo's copy look
# like the live standard while a box had been editing its own for days.
data/

